Package: golosovRST
Type: Package
Title: Golosov Relative Size Triangle Classification and Plotting
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Federico",
           family = "Taddei",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "federico.taddei@unimi.it")
Description: Computes coordinates for the Golosov Relative Size Triangle (RST),
    classifies party-system observations into Golosov subtypes using polygon mapping
    and produces publication-ready Relative Size Triangle plots.
    Method reference: Golosov, G. V. (2011) "Party system classification: A
    methodological inquiry" <doi:10.1177/1354068810377189>.
